  "_doc": "Per-business slot schema. Copy to private-business/relationship/config/profile-schema.json to change it. Each slot names the card (entity) it belongs to, so remember() routes a fact to the person, the partner organization or the revenue partnership. sources = where a fact may come from; not_from_model = slots only systems of record or the owner set; never_store = categories refused on every write path.",
